fixture down_strike_landing_jump
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 8 "Attack-cancel landing: landing never interrupts an attack"; s5 Jump "Landing: 0 f of lag"; docs/adr/0010: once grounded, a jump cancels the down-strike
room test/flat
spawn 400 520
frames 30
input
  0 D attack
  3 jump
end
expect
  at 0 action=down
  # The down-strike whiffs into the floor. Landing does not end it (tech 8), but the jump pressed
  # on its frame 4, which the airborne strike blocks, is not locked out: it fires on the landing
  # frame, out of the strike.
  never 0..6 event.jump=1
  mark land 0..10 event.land=1
  at land event.jump=1 action=down vy<0
end
